{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Math Master": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) (3 - x) + 5 = 4(x - 3) হলে x = ?", "option1": "ক) 1/4", "option2": "খ) 1/3", "option3": "গ) 3", "option4": "ঘ) 4", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>(3 - x) + 5 = 4(x - 3)<br />বা, -(x - 3) + 5 = 4(x - 3)<br />বা, 5(x - 3) = 5<br />বা, x - 3 = 1<br />&there4; x = 4</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) x/4 - x/5 = (x - 1)/10 সমীকরণের সমাধান-", "option1": "ক) -1", "option2": "খ) -2", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x/4 - x/5 = (x - 1)/10<br />বা, (5x - 4x)/20 = (x - 1)/10<br />বা, x/20 = (x - 1)/10<br />বা, x/2 = x - 1<br />বা, x = 2x - 2<br />বা, x = 2</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) কোন একটি সংখ্যার এক তৃতীয়াংশের সাথে 5 যোগ করলে যোগফল, সংখ্যাটির তিনগুণের সাথে 25 যোগ করলে ঐ যোগফলের সমান হয়। সংখ্যাটি কত?", "option1": "ক) - 15/2", "option2": "খ) - 15", "option3": "গ) 15/2", "option4": "ঘ) 15", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>মনে করি,<br />সংখ্যাটি x<br />&there4; x/3 + 5 = 3x + 25<br />বা, x + 15 = 9x + 75 [উভয়পক্ষকে 3 দ্বারা গুণ করে]<br />বা, 8x = - 60<br />বা, x = - 60/8 = - 15/2</p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) 3/(x - 1) + 2/(x - 2) = 5/(x - 3) হলে x = ?", "option1": "ক) - 7/4", "option2": "খ) 7/4", "option3": "গ) 7/3", "option4": "ঘ) - 7/3", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>3/(x - 1) + 2/(x - 2) = 5/(x - 3)<br />বা, 3/(x - 1) + 2/(x - 2) = 3/(x - 3) + 2/(x - 3)<br />বা, 2/(x - 2) - 2/(x - 3) = 3/(x - 3) - 3/(x - 1)<br />বা, 2(x - 3 - x + 2)/(x - 2)(x - 3) = 3(x - 1 - x + 3)/(x - 3)(x - 1)<br />বা, -2/(x - 2) = 6/(x - 1) [উভয়পক্ষকে (x - 3) দ্বারা গুণ করে]<br />বা, -1/(x - 2) = 3/(x - 1) [উভয়পক্ষকে 2 দ্বারা ভাগ করে]<br />বা, 3x - 6 = -x + 1<br />বা, 4x = 7<br />&there4; x = 7/4</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) x<sup>2</sup> + 2x - 143 = 0 সমীকরণের একটি সমাধান-", "option1": "ক) -11", "option2": "খ) -12", "option3": "গ) 11", "option4": "ঘ) 13", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> + 2x - 143 = 0<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> + 13x - 11x - 143 = 0<br />বা, x(x + 13) - 11(x + 13) = 0<br />বা, (x + 13)(x - 11) = 0<br />&there4; x = 11, -13</p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) 6x<sup>2</sup> - 8x + 1 = 0 সমীকরণের মূলের প্রকৃতি-", "option1": "ক) বাস্তব ও সমান", "option2": "খ) বাস্তব ও অসমান", "option3": "গ) মূলদ", "option4": "ঘ) অবাস্তব", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>সমীকরণের নিশ্চায়ক = (-8)<sup>2</sup> - 4.6.1<br />= 64 - 24<br />= 40 &gt; 0<br />&there4; মূলদ্বয় বাস্তব এবং অসমান।</p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) 4x<sup>2</sup> - px + 9 = 0 সমীকরণের মূলদ্বয় বাস্তব ও সমান হলে p = ?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 9", "option3": "গ) 4", "option4": "ঘ) 12", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>নিশ্চায়ক = ০ (কারণ, মূলদ্বয় বাস্তব ও সমান)<br />বা, p<sup>2</sup> - 4.4.9 = 0<br />বা, p<sup>2</sup> = 144<br />&there4; p = 12</p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) 3x + 2y = 7 এবং 2x = y হলে, y = কত?", "option1": "ক) -2", "option2": "খ) -1", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>3x + 2y = 7<br />বা, 3x + 2.2x = 7<br />বা, 7x = 7<br />&there4; x = 1<br />&there4; y = 2x = 2.1 <br />&there4; y = 2</p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = 185 এবং y = x + 3 হলে x + y = ?", "option1": "ক) 18", "option2": "খ) 19", "option3": "গ) 20", "option4": "ঘ) 21", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>দেওয়া আছে,<br />y = x + 3<br />বা, x - y = -3<br />এবং,<br />x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = 185<br />&there4; (x - y)<sup>2</sup> + 2xy = 185<br />বা, 2xy = 185 - (x - y)<sup>2</sup><br />= 185 - (-3)<sup>2</sup><br />= 185 - 9<br />= 176<br />বা, xy = 88<br />= 8 &times; 11<br />&there4; x = 8, y = 11<br />&there4; x + y = 11 + 8<br />= 19</p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) x/3 - 2/y = 1 এবং x/4 + 3/y = 3 হলে (x, y) = ?", "option1": "ক) (6, 3)", "option2": "খ) (2, 6)", "option3": "গ) (3, 6)", "option4": "ঘ) (6, 2)", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x/3 - 2/y = 1 ............... (1)<br />x/4 + 3/y = 3 ............... (2)<br /><br />(1) নং কে 3 এবং (2) নং 2 দ্বারা গুণ করে পাই,<br />x - 6/y = 3<br />x/2 + 6/y = 6<br />------------------<br />x + x/2 =